    "tactics": "Guard Dogs alert their handlers, flank intruders, and attack the nearest creature that crosses the boundary they are protecting. They hold a target in place rather than pursuing beyond their post.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Bite [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 8 damage (5 + 3 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 8 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Keen Smell: Scent-based Perception checks have Fortune. Hold the Intruder: When the Guard Dog hits with Margin 2, the target must make a Fortitude save opposed by the dog's Str 4 + Athletics 3. On a loss, the target is knocked Prone. Trained Guard: The Guard Dog does not bolt when frightened or injured while protecting its assigned area. It still follows the ordinary mount rules if ridden, though it is not a mount by default.</p>",
